{
  "id": "LUK.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa nsaatu ha sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkabiza ho sabato ndebe, ū Yesu ūja ha ng'wa ntaale ūmò wa Bafalisayo, ūūkingīla mu kaya kūlya shilīwa. A boi bandya kūng'witega tega gīkī bamone ūmo alīītīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a ha būtongi bokwe olīho munhū asaatile būsaatu bo kūduduma mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbawīla a balangi ba shilagīlo na a Bafalisayo, ūhaya gīkī, “Bing'we a ha sabato īzunīlīgije ū kūpīja nūūlū yaya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būgayiwa ū gwa kūnshokeja. Hūna ūndima ū nsaatu ūmpīja, ūnaga ūja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūbawīla a boi gīkī, “Ī gīsī, a bing'we ūlū ūmò wing'we alī na ng'wana nūūlū ng'ombe, hūna yūgwīla ng'wichongo ha lūshikū lo sabato, nani ūyo atūkalagana kwīfunya mo haho na haho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahene batanshokegije mhayo ū mu yenīyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būbi wa kwitūūla kū būtongi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wababona balīyisolela masumbī ga makūjo abo baalī balaalīkwa, ūbawīla mu shigemeng'hejo gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ūlaalīkwa na munhū kūja kū būyegi bo būkombe, ūtizūshikīla kwigasīja isumbī ly'ikūjo, atizūbiza na munhū ūngī alaalīkilwe, ūyo hamo nīyo akūjiwe kūtinda ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūyo wamulaalīkile būbīlī wing'we ashikile kwiza ūkūwīla gīkī, ‘Bebe īngaga a henaho igashe ū baba ūyū!’ A henaho ūkūgooka no, nguno ūkūshoka ha wigasho bo ha sīlīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūlaalīkwa shikīlaga hi sūmbi lya hanūma, hūna ūlū wiza ūyo wamulaalīkile, akūkūwīla gīkī, ‘Ong'wise jaga ūkigasīje līlo a higūlya aho.’ Ū mu gīko ūkūbi ūlī na shingilima ū kū būtongi wa bose abo wigashaga nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo wigūngūhya wei ng'wenekīlī akūdohelejiwa, alīyo ūyo widohya akūgūngūhiwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo walī wang'wegeleja kūlya shilīwa nang'hwe ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe nang'ho ūlū ūbeeja shilīwa sha kūyega na banhū, yaya ū kūsolanhya banwani biyo dūhū ū mu kalaalīkīle, nūūlū hamo ba mu kaya ya ng'wing'we dūhū. Nūūlū badūgūyo na bazenganwa biyo a basabi dūhū, abo ūmanile gīkī bashikile kūkūlaalīka nū bebe; nang'ho ūpandīke mheela mu gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūbeeja shilīwa sha kūyega na banhū, bitanage a bahabī na a bagokolo, na a balemehazu, na a babboku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kwīta gīko ūkūbiza na lubango; nguno a boi batī na mheela ya kūkwinha, alīyo ūkwinhwa ng'wikanza lya būjūūko wa batūngīlīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lwa shigukulu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa babo baalī bigasha nang'hwe ū Yesu aho wigwa ī yenīyo ūhaya gīkī, “Alī na lubango būlī ng'wene ūyo akūlya shilīwa ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūng'wīla gīkī, “Munhū nebe akabeeja shigukulu shitaale, ūlaalīka banhū bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ī likanza lya shilīwa ūtūma nsese wakwe kūjūbitana abo baalī balaalīkwa. Kūbawīla gīkī, ‘Bing'we nzūgi lūūlū, nguno ī haha pyī ī shose shalonjiagwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bakabiza gītī baalī balagana pye a bose, būlī ng'wene ūlomba kūlekejiwa. Ūmò ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Baba naagūlile ilaale, nalīja kūlīlola, nalīkūlomba ūnilekeje nguno natūdūla ū kwiza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūngī ūhaya, ‘Baba naagūlile tūyīkū ikūmi twa kūlīma, nalīja kūtūgema; na lūūlū nalīkūlomba ūnilekeje, nguno natūdūla ū kwiza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ūngī hangī nang'hwe ūhaya, ‘Yee baba ka naatoolile haha no, na lūūlū natūdūla ū kwiza!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsese ng'wenūyo wiza wīhaya pyī ī yenīyo ū kūlī ise būgonzo. Ū ng'wenekīlī kaya akapelana no, ūng'wīla ū nsese wakwe gīkī. ‘Jaga wangū pye a hose ū mu nzengo; ūbīta bīta ū mu nzīla ī nhaale nī ndo; ūbenhe aha a bahabī na a bagokolo, na a babboku, na a balema.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū nsese ūhaya, ‘Baba ūyo ūlīgūhaya gwenūyo gwamalaga kwītwa, alīyo ī numba ītaalī ū kokala!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise būgonzo ūng'wīla ū nsese ng'wenūyo gīkī, ‘Jaga na kū mapanda, pyī nū kū mayīla a mataale, ūūbakomeleja na nguzu bize, kūshisha yokale ī numba yane! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalīmuwīla gīkī, pye abo baalī balaalīkilwe atīho nūūlū ūmò wabo ūyo akūshiloja nūūlū hado ī shilīwa sha ha ng'wane!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būdito wa kūhembekwa na Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabita na mabita ga banhū gankūūbījaga ū Yesu, nang'hwe aho wabagalūkīla ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ose ose ūlū wiza kūlī nene alīyo atankolilwe ise nūūlū nina, nūūlū nke, nūūlū baana bakwe, nūūlū baana ba ng'wawe bagosha na bakīma; pyī nūūlū būpanga bokwe wei ng'wenekīlī, atūdūla ū kūbiza ng'hemba wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ūyo alīnilondeela alīyo atibūūkīgije nsalaba gokwe wei ng'wenekīlī, nū ng'wene atūdūla ū kūbiza ng'hemba wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, alīho munhū kī ū mu bing'we ūyo adūgije kwandya nzenga aho ataalī kwigasha tame na kūbūlola ū būdito bo nzenga yenīyo, abone ūlū alī najo ī sabo ja kūdūla kwīmala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno atizūgelela kūtūūla nsingi dūhū, hūna ūlemeelwa ū kwīshikīlīja. A henaho abo bakūbonaga bakwandya kūyūnseka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balīhaya gīkī, ‘Mulīmona ū ng'wing'wana ūyū; olī wihamba hambile nzenga, yanemeelile ū kwīmalīja!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hangī, ntemi kī ūlū alī na bashilikale shihūmbī ikūmi, ūyo atandya igashe tame kwiganika chiza ūlū adūgije kwamba būlūgū kwilwisha na ntemi ng'wiye, ūyo aliza kūndumīla na bashilikale shihūmbī makūmi abīlī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbona gīkī atūdūla, akūtūma nhūng'wa wangū ū kūlī ng'wanishi kūko ataalī kūle, amane ūlū shilīho shose shose īsho shidūgije kwenha mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lūūlū na a bing'we, būlī ng'wene ūyo atūdūla kūlekana gete najo ī sabo jakwe pyī ī jose, atūdūla ū kūbiza ng'hemba wane! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhu ng'hana gūlī gwawiza, alīyo ū munhu ūlū gūlinda gūsūūka, angū, gūdūgije kūsandūchiwa kī hangī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūtūdūla nūūlū kūgunanha sī, pyī nūūlū ni kūtūmama gītī mboleela; gūkūbiza gwa kūponyiwa hanze dūhū! Ūyo alī na matū gakigwaga ni igwage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
